"""GATE 4 — STAGE 2. METRICS, INTERVALS, RANKING. The apparatus is FROZEN.

⛔ NOTHING HERE TUNES ANYTHING. Every constant is READ from a frozen artifact:
    gate4_support_calibration.json  -> retention window + support_min_hz
    fuzz_gate4_lib.json             -> the ranking roster and the state-aware
                                       ABSOLUTE instrument floors
    gate2_matrix.json               -> route, sr_out, geometry
    GATE4_CORPUS.json               -> the corpus selection
No value below is typed from memory, and no threshold is chosen from results.

⭐ THE STRUCTURAL GUARANTEE (mandatory, GATE4_PREREG §6.1.5 limitation 2).
The support-before-ranking ordering was a WRITTEN RULE. Here it is made
MECHANICAL and then PROVEN:

    A cell's `mcd` is stored as a NUMBER only when `in_support` is True.
    Outside the domain the field holds a STATE STRING and `mcd_value` is None.
    `rankable(...)` is the ONLY door into every interval, bootstrap and
    ranking, and it admits a cell solely on `cell["mcd_value"] is not None`.

`--prove` injects support-failing cells and asserts they reach NO ranking input
by ANY path. It fails loudly rather than warning.

    python gate4_metrics.py --prove              # the structural proof, no data
    python gate4_metrics.py --arm <name>         # per-cell metrics, resumable
    python gate4_metrics.py --all                # every arm, sequential
    python gate4_metrics.py --aggregate          # intervals, floors, ranking
"""

